## Verification & Expected Outcome
Run `verify.sh` or check cluster status:
```bash
kubectl get deployment web-app
```
Expected Output:
```
NAME      READY   UP-TO-DATE   AVAILABLE   AGE
web-app   1/1     1            1           3m
```
The pod `web-app-*` must report `READY 1/1` and status `Running` with `0` active restarts.
